---
/*
  M2 — the strip runs on the brand mood image (seedlings on coin stacks, from
  plan-t.org.il) under a navy duotone. Green appears only on the CTA button,
  per design law 2. The image is decorative: empty alt, lazy.
*/
---

<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-ink-950" aria-labelledby="webinar-strip-title">
  <picture>
    <source srcset="/images/mood-growth.webp" type="image/webp" />
    <img
      src="/images/mood-growth.jpg"
      alt=""
      width="1920"
      height="736"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
      class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-45"
      aria-hidden="true"
    />
  </picture>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-l from-ink-950/85 via-ink-950/60 to-ink-950/85" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center gap-4 px-4 py-10 text-center md:flex-row md:justify-between md:text-start">
    <div>
      <h2 id="webinar-strip-title" class="text-2xl font-black text-white">
        וובינר השקה: Plan-t AI
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-ink-200">
        שני מועדים לבחירה — <span class="ltr font-bold text-white">13.10.2026</span> או&#32;<span
          class="ltr font-bold text-white">15.10.2026</span>. ההשתתפות ללא עלות.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a
      href="/webinar/"
      class="rounded-full bg-accent-500 px-8 py-3 text-lg font-bold text-ink-950 transition-colors hover:bg-accent-400"
    >
      להרשמה לוובינר
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
